    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d51580c699e6b0d495bbe022",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "唔喔喔，为什么！？为什么我总是会在\n重要的比赛输给怒涛？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf2dbb7336c5247bf3371a3bc1621d7acfffffaa8846ca238621b2a762c77bba",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
