      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/6/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2ce3e221a696f13091922146",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛",
      "source_fingerprint": "567703d9275812a37613cd54f05008f5fba9ac6c5086fcadc58481ab61c51fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ca2364612c9396ed41014f93",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可是，好歌剧，我应该是不可能\n会像这样大获全胜的啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "b79fe1ac60394744dfdd22a7e59490e5b93db09c705d45a832d94629a101079f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        7,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/7/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f7647ee83e18bd667303ef0",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛",
      "source_fingerprint": "567703d9275812a37613cd54f05008f5fba9ac6c5086fcadc58481ab61c51fce",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25c112bca5e3ac1033d2ec66",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "该不会我们两个人……",
      "source_fingerprint": "545d0246da2f9a3c40fd19c9fd2c5534b187898a61cc6183e69dfb7f8d70efe4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        8,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/8/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dd86d529b0310e33a96272d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "好歌剧",
      "source_fingerprint": "0e675a751a02376dc54b1b2892d4a4f859f0505240d1cc6277fe26728ca618f0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2714849e74d286f4c9fe473d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "喔喔，我们难不成……",
      "source_fingerprint": "5fba138da49bd725398669ebfeead9f0f5e6f2312770dacc22c7b4a987ac2eb4",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a22f316d87a35bd246d9e191",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "创举！我是霸王！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "46a62d5a8eda28073250051870bc6014942a63552d0021359f4e8517cf4b0c4d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058321.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:92a62cf2b539b49fe21671d2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我将要和懦弱又笨拙的赛马娘──名将怒涛\n开始挑战闪耀系列赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "da3aa5cda56fb5df3f2ffdfe6f142aa794b1b542e2fb124863a939e64769388a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd5db83b26ab329b36fea43b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛的目标，是变得像她的同期\n好歌剧一样，充满信心又耀眼。",
      "source_fingerprint": "82f3b6f15cca6a2ca45d28f47c7173c23fd906803021e7f6deaa8bfe242cf0fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:054ceb2867fdbb51ce3e7fbe",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然受到朋友待兼福来的鼓励，\n但室友空中神宫却给了她一个\n“就数据来看实在不够格”的惨烈评价。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36c5e44cf386f84ac69ec2bf215e05169e463f5a5435fd5433aa9fca4624d15a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:741616c2acfaaf971d02d8a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "尽管如此，不轻言放弃就是她最大的优点。\n相信自己会获得救赎的名将怒涛，\n就这样朝着目标起跑了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3eb995ef33869ededa0fcde43674d51ccafb3d2a2b13766b69c1100446039013",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d597097086e4ac2dcd1234cd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛登场！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6828032c1c16f5150e41ac31e72c78cf2a56b706add42a9326f1b4880ef4e9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058400.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2abddc1e1ba2144ca055a14d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛跟好歌剧一同去观看\n前一个世代的德比赛况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d272bf0d58f7d194c47568aaede95b930585c5593c6c8462c64a7c296d62cfb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc2d0bcfc948bbb638044a17",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赢得比赛的人是特别周。\n而其他的赛马娘也净是强者云集，\n“最强世代”这个名号当之无愧……",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f3bd94ae34979b8c1c5e2fb5afd8b6028f1c45cd722ca8c6f3456da36980553",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b27c325d08cf436b64405785",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "相较之下，名将怒涛则是\n对缺乏实力的自己感到慌张失措……",
      "source_fingerprint": "aafda81d7790c4e9ba3f3e5cf1ac6d3d90fcfcdb65c8ff5df6a55c6e8eb1f662",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:170ba44441f3a9867d5eadf2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在好歌剧的喝斥下，名将怒涛回过了神来。\n接着她燃起非比寻常的干劲，\n准备迎接出道战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "392d8c22c79d65212dd859c7b0fc22d9251e22a57c209d238d1242c41037604c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4f6d5add7971aba86fbb4680",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "突然来到东京优骏",
      "source_fingerprint": "6b92c49fb587ea5c1aa4639b9536b42f92b8b36dc5339267fb99970af9ac1b18",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058401.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cfe9360dfe60aa2419720f53",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛每天都拼命地追着好歌剧的脚步。\n然而，就在这个时候……\n阪神赛场诞生了一位崭新的巨星。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4ff731774290b3cd290d718f75589b0f29827cc59447fae285cc481d19696a6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7e2bbde540b884ccc5e415a7",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她是爱慕织姬，一个沉默寡言的冷酷赛马娘。\n她的表现毫无疑问地足以担纲经典赛主角。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d98bb99ebeb1b92af39a2a809a13789c01f60deae73b01ebe7eee10b0a93765",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e920d05d11acc16507bd1264",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "某天，名将怒涛在特雷森学园的走廊\n和爱慕织姬撞个正着──",
      "source_fingerprint": "e8a3ddfff852a2f6a22c6d1f190bf56d08debb2fe8ee010dc6c2879a62c150e6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72980c707afb75d79bbb96cb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "爱慕织姬却完全不为所动。\n见识到她那强韧的下盘后，名将怒涛\n这才了解到一线级的厉害之处。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e73b32b2831f130bbe6e479ea48a610e171458b0d43d902322f91d67f09f4180",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5efcd9596fae92861c0fbda",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "现身！孤傲的新星",
      "source_fingerprint": "bbcd29884c848d0361c2a0c948837b62dd366a3b007901209b620b8e611d2205",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058402.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:98d74140453c8bbaa1d6cd9d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a767dc4c60dc30acd19872b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "河川的水量──因雨水而增加了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "868a5e8e68d44f181431dc64b2eaf8534d06d5e30b4102bb1af5c2b2dbb9c972",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9ba4d6e124f7655cf923e01a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058403.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d783cb7df3e0bbdfdb73351f",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫看着那条河，同时开始\n谈论起自己对“数值上限”的看法。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9ca0ffd0f4e32fbbfb33fd5198adf4060cf4ba3457f28e6f156e87246f07053",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
