    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e798268463503abd6fe52040",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "河川本身有其阈值，一旦容纳了超过\n阈值的水量，便会满溢而出。\n或是导致河川直接溃堤……",
      "source_fingerprint": "decedb2739ba305fad0b2aff26e8f3bb856d7e6c18ec1c04f6478fda444783c3",
