    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81227d293d6440654aa586b1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天所举办的是下一个世代的德比。\n大热门空中神宫以仅仅七厘米的差距，\n与荣耀失之交臂……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6934af27f33fea024565f425d67233bfa02305da6187c22bf22c98a87236e77",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba038cfb5e812c0add89a633",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c81fb7c2b58cd34fc510a72b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是当事人却不怎么沮丧。\n这个结果似乎正如她所料。",
      "source_fingerprint": "96ae9865badab62394ca4ed6b4bd2e5d51b0735fde846fabf682c37998d80d02",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
