      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17eb88d6bd54c47f92ad5e4d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "未来──会趋向数值所展现出的结果。\n如果真如她所言，那么名将怒涛在未来，\n应该也无法突破上限……",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6839da7087cf13be27a5782fdf466e32071e9651e313c795adde987cdb1287c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b3b4b88071cf2e387388ab1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
      "source_fingerprint": "182cc3cf530783b6da4d14ed3d7d177e4428e3ba9645975eb9ef22934b7d221c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59056b59461842bbe44bfc18",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但如果是数值原本就不稳定的名将怒涛，\n说不定能够推翻这个计算的结果──\n空中神宫对她抱持着如此的期待。",
      "source_fingerprint": "154b37e66fffa0764b9e614c83ca6db716ff5f84d50595fa432daf528605e8bb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a2884f11bb4ff4c2835abf43",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中神宫的德比",
      "source_fingerprint": "32a64079d00d8be61e0dce49fc4fddcc89273e3d85c3f6baa3fed8e3f94502fb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058404.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e703500aef96eaee7b6d0955",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“你不拿出要打败好歌剧的气魄，就不会有\n未来可言。”训练员与爱慕织姬下定决心，\n如此地告诉了名将怒涛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "14b66152f655f143b59a5c1e81fef314f5e243bd674e32f3e0383ce92179d594",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:09f35ed1abe1b7d457fde05d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不仅是当事人会没有未来，就连好歌剧\n也一样。只要她不让自己在竞争中成长，\n就会输给上一个世代。",
      "source_fingerprint": "424b578e6e108b806b30c13b08380ef9792119120020a3fb958abd6200374bdb",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d94d08538de22b09d2dd4138",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "接着──她彻底觉醒了。\n推动着名将怒涛的，是她一直以来\n都从未主动放弃过的坚毅斗志。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2d1fd07f85c11b176b07ca99c10243c6063321a82bee569270cfc641534ff2ff",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:46318bfc374a587e2019fcf1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为了自己，也为了好歌剧。\n名将怒涛决定要在“日本杯”上，\n向好歌剧宣战。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dc49b9551c12ca4c6fa80a197e02d7c230c91246720edc0d9e50a7d1d0c7ccc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        3,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/3/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f195826b1d5dd45737d3d64d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "坚定的步伐",
      "source_fingerprint": "bef25a4770351a8a7c3b8994ab31131ac2b3ce0ea5f8e8e41581c4ef69655887",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058405.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
