    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb19364699ea94c2f0f1d0eb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "夏季集训开始了。名将怒涛原本想\n自己悄悄地度过，免得妨碍到实力坚强的\n好歌剧和爱慕织姬……",
      "source_fingerprint": "92d73c5785a0dad9d81341647e4fd67c004182cf1f32cb0af71140606e8f1618",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058406.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4bb8610dadaea88efdc8307a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "独白",
