    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d46fadeb880c5b9bb8b2feb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但受到她们超乎想像的认可，\n还加入成为她们的一员，\n这让名将怒涛喜出望外。",
      "source_fingerprint": "01b05594e80d97bfef49131c6fd794916c1bb406fcd30b7f73430b7a15f7fcfc",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058406.json",
      "json_path": [
