    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2796f57cd19bfdbde63d5fdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "再加上当地的狸猫也莫名地很亲近她，\n于是三个人加一只动物的夏天开始了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "abb7b79c40adf266903ae317815a0d49985dc93bb2d1373c3ade54de58b9e6e3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1058/storytimeline_501058406.json",
      "json_path": [
