    {
      "uid": "zhcn:783300ca1c804c2768b2e61d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "名将怒涛相信，只要在这次夏季集训中，\n让自己有再进一步的成长，\n那即使面对前一个世代也能取胜。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1705b962c99fdbc1ef5de14b7b35511469003e3e4cd57ce7e7b4a05e72212874",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
